      "raw": "<p>Here&#39;s how we&#39;ve been playing Apostate. &nbsp;Please let me know if we have been doing it correctly.</p><p>Apostate&#39;s relics say &quot;Apostate does X damage&quot;. &nbsp;So for the purposes of certain targeting, or preventing damage from targets, would those relics count as targets or Apostate? &nbsp;We&#39;ve been playing it that Apostate is the target. &nbsp;Not talking about when we attack targets, but more when certain effects reference the source of an attack. &nbsp; I&#39;m sorry that I don&#39;t remember the exact cards we were using where this came up, but it involved either Bunker or Fanatic. &nbsp;Similarly, whenever Fanatic took damage from a relic-based power, we added +1 to it for Apostate&#39;s nemesis effect. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
